           "https://images1.apartments.com/i2/oWr3cuWH7Onlxxi_bxtx7CngslaKm3o4rTSisw61Dbs/102/image.jpg"
          ],
          "description": "Edison Austin Apartments offers upscale living with modern studio, one-, and two-bedroom floor plans featuring wood-style plank flooring, sleek kitchens, and...",
          "yearBuilt": 2019,
          "totalUnits": 354,
          "rating": 4,
          "website": "https://edisonaustin.com/?utm_source=apartments",
          "lastUpdated": "2026-10-14T17:24:53.423-04:00",
          "scrapedAt": "2026-10-15T11:19:35+00:00"
         }
        ]
       }
      }
     },
     "400": {
      "description": "The request body does not fit the input fields. The message says which field."
     }
    }
